<!--
  Synthetic Infosys (BSE scrip 500209) Q4 FY25 (Jan-Mar 2025) CONSOLIDATED
  Ind AS instance under the in-capmkt "Integrated Filing" taxonomy.

  Hand-built fixture reproducing the STRUCTURE of a real BSE
  IFIndasUploadDocument/Integrated_Finance_Ind_As_*.xml instance without
  redistributing BSE's copyrighted source bytes. It proves the parser's taxonomy
  registry handles the second BSE namespace (in-capmkt) additively.

  NOTE: the in-capmkt namespace URI here mirrors bse_source.IN_CAPMKT_NAMESPACE so
  the deterministic test is self-consistent; the production URI must be confirmed
  against a real Integrated Filing instance. Numeric values are the
  plausibility-checked Q4 FY25 figures recorded in
  docs/research/crawl4ai-nse-bse-evaluation.md (Revenue 40,925 / PBT 9,663 /
  PAT 7,038 Cr) — not independently audited.
-->
